---
const year = 2026;
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-coral-light bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-12 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-ink-primary">KCYF</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1">Keep Connecting Your Family</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        仕事に追われる毎日でも、<br />
        家族のあたたかさを<br class="sm:hidden" />手放さずにいられる社会へ。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-primary mb-3">サイト</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-secondary">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-coral-dark">ホーム</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-coral-dark">事業について</a></li>
        <li><a href="/okocchi" class="hover:text-coral-dark">おこっち</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-coral-dark">お問い合わせ</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-primary mb-3">おこっち（規約）</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-secondary">
        <li><a href="/okocchi/privacy" class="hover:text-coral-dark">プライバシーポリシー</a></li>
        <li><a href="/okocchi/terms" class="hover:text-coral-dark">利用規約</a></li>
        <li><a href="/okocchi/support" class="hover:text-coral-dark">サポート</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary mt-4">
        <a href="mailto:support@kcyf.jp" class="hover:text-coral-dark">support@kcyf.jp</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-coral-light/60">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 text-xs text-ink-muted text-center">
      © {year} KCYF
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
